 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Projective morphisms and projective schemes",
 "statement": "A morphism of schemes $f:X\\to Y$ is *projective* if there are\nan integer $N\\ge0$ and a\nclosed immersion\n$i:X\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf P^N_Y$ such that $f$ is the composite\nof $i$ with the structural projection $\\mathbf P^N_Y\\to Y$. A\nscheme is projective over a field $k$ if its structure morphism is\nprojective.",
